msgstr "Nakamen: En eenfach Projekt opstellen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: about/aboutpage.cpp:182
msgid "Create the simplest project ever."
msgstr "Dat eenfachste Projekt överhööft opstellen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: about/aboutpage.cpp:184
#, kde-format
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Create a task by selecting <em>Add Task</em> in the toolbar.</li>"
"<li>Set <em>Estimate Type</em> to <em>Duration</em>.</li>"
"<li>Set <em>Estimate</em> to <em>8 hours</em>.</li>"
"<li>Set <em>Constraint</em> to <em>As Soon As Possible</em>.</li>"
"</ul>"
"Select the schedules editor <em>Editors->Schedules</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Create a schedule by selecting <em>Add Schedule</em> in the toolbar.</li>"
"<li>Calculate the schedule by selecting <em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar.</li>"
"</ul>"
"The task should now have been scheduled to start %1 with a duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the gantt chart <em>Views->Gantt</em>."
msgstr ""
"Roop den Opgaveneditor op: <em>Editoren -> Opgaven</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Stell mit <em>Opgaav tofögen</em> ut den Warktüüchbalken en Opgaav op.</li>"
"<li>Sett <em>Estemeren-Typ</em> op <em>Duer</em>.</li>"
"<li>Sett <em>Estemeren</em> op <em>8 Stünnen</em>.</li>"
"<li>Sett <em>Bedingen</em> op <em>As fröh as mööglich</em>.</li>"
"</ul>"
"Roop den Plaaneditor op: <em>Editoren -> Plaans</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Stell mit <em>Plaan tofögen</em> ut den Warktüüchbalken en Plaan op.</li>"
"<li>Kalkuleer den Plaan mit <em>Utreken</em> ut den Warktüüchbalken.</li>"
"</ul>"
"Nu schall plaant wesen, dat de Opgaav Klock %1 start un 8 Stünnen duert. Dat lett sik mit dat Balkenplaandiagramm <em>Ansichten -> Balkenplaan</em> pröven."

#. +> trunk stable
#: about/aboutpage.cpp:200
msgid "Next: Resource allocation"
msgstr "Nakamen: Ressource-Towiesen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: about/aboutpage.cpp:211
msgid "Allocate a resource to the task."
msgstr "En Ressource na en Opgaav towiesen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: about/aboutpage.cpp:213
#, kde-format
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Enter a name (e.g. 'John') in the <em>Allocation</em> column. (KPlato will automatically create a resource with name 'John' under resource group 'Resources'.</li>"
"<li>Set <em>Estimate Type</em> to <em>Effort</em>.</li>"
"</ul>"
"Now you need to schedule the project again with the new allocation:<br>"
"Select the schedules editor <em>Editors->Schedules</em> and calculate the schedule by selecting <em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar."
"<p>The task should be scheduled to start %1 with a duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the gantt chart <em>Views->Gantt</em>."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"Roop den Opgaveneditor op: <em>Editoren -> Opgaven</em>:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Giff in den Striep <em>Towiesen</em> en Naam (a.B. »Jan«) in. (KPlato stellt ünner Ressourcenkoppel »Ressourcen« automaatsch en Ressource mit den Naam »Jan« op.</li>"
"<li>Sett <em>Estemeren-Typ</em> op <em>Leisten</em>.</li>"
"</ul>"
"Nu muttst Du dat Projekt wedder mit disse Toornen nieg planen:<br>"
"Roop den Plaaneditor op <em>Editoren -> Plaans</em>, un kalkuleer den Plaan mit <em>Utreken</em> ut den Warktüüchbalken."
"<p>Nu schall plaant wesen, dat de Opgaav Klock %1 start un 8 Stünnen duert. Dat lett sik mit dat Balkenplaandiagramm <em>Ansichten -> Balkenplaan</em> pröven."
"<p>"

